msgid "Date, time and UTC offset are explicit. The selected time stays fixed during flight; OS time is not used."
msgstr "La fecha, la hora y el desfase UTC son explícitos. La hora seleccionada permanece fija durante el vuelo; no se usa la hora del sistema."

msgid "Legacy daylight keeps the original fixed daylight look; choose astronomical time to use the selected local time."
msgstr "La luz diurna clásica conserva el aspecto fijo original; elige la hora astronómica para usar la hora local seleccionada."

msgid "The Sun is more than 6° below the horizon. There are no aircraft or field lights, so the airplane may be difficult to see."
